{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事へのコメントして下さった方ありがとうございます。ヽ(・・｡)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2000以上のコメントで、\nすっごくにびっくりしています(º_º)♡\nほんとに嬉しすぎます♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいの\nおめでとうや頑張ってっていう\nあったかいコメントに嬉しすぎて感動"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとうにほんとうにありがとう｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popモデルになれたイコール\n認められたってわけじゃなく\nここがスタートであって、、\n安心じゃなくて\nここから新たなたたかい｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしに関わる全ての方に感謝しながら\n読者の皆さんに認めてもらえるよう\nせいいっぱい頑張ろうっ前向きにねっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢は\n諦めなかったら\n言い続けたら\nどんな場所にいても叶う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことを証明したい｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後が証明できたら\nなんだか自分も出来そうじゃん、頑張ろっ\nて思ってもらえたらいいな｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親友からおめでとうメールと\n一緒に中１にクラスでつくった\n夢ノート(文集みたいなの)\nにひなが書いた夢の写真がおくられてきた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にも\n生のアイドルが好きを\nさゆりん代打で\nひながかなりんとMCしたときのしゃしん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アフィリア・サーガさんと\nアイドリング!!!さんが\nゲストに来てくださいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しすぎたな～♡\nまた生ドルでたいなーヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルプレスさんが\nわたしの記事をかいてくれていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://mdpr.jp/news/1497782"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしいです♡\nありがとうございます｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\nゆらひなの記事もありました･･･♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://mdpr.jp/gal/1498013"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実現できたらいいなっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はすぐ更新するね！！\n待っててね！>_<"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/07/11/2663950/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Seeyou...♡"}],"source":"archive"}